# engine_plugins/unreal_verify - build output and the copied plugin
#
# Plugins/ is a copy of ../unreal plus the library, the ONNX Runtime DLLs and the model (see setup.ps1), and none
# of it is source. Binaries/, Intermediate/, Saved/ and DerivedDataCache/ are Unreal's build output; the .sln and
# .vs are what UBT generates for a project with a C++ plugin.
